"notes":[
"New models for the Act IV bosses: the Ferryman is a hooded boatman with his ferry pole and lantern, and Nhal and the Sand Coil are a great wingless serpent rising out of the ground in coils.",
"Lamp posts are shorter and sturdier with much bigger lanterns, so they read from the game camera.",
"Bridge decks no longer look blotchy; the Hollow's crystal forest glows less, so the fight stands out.",
"Main buttons (Start, Continue, Choose your hero) are brighter, so they no longer look greyed out."
]
